    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>M.E.M.O demo (\u03b1)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>M.E.M.O demo (\u03b1)</strong> where you can get a sneak peek into the world of &quot;M.E.M.O&quot;!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While some features are yet to be implemented in this version, you can already experience the captivating world setting and core cryptography gameplay that makes &quot;M.E.M.O&quot; special.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972940/extras/ec9253fd64aa788b7d39d66e904d29dc.avif?t=1752827754\" width=800 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203bPlease have paper and pen ready when playing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203bThe demo(\u03b2) is scheduled for release in December 2025.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203bThis demo may differ from the final product.<br><br>\u203bThe screenshots shown are all from the development stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972940/extras/ccebdf1b68f19f19c6f364d634447bae.webp?t=1752827754\" width=616 height=23 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Midway through a life filled with regret,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > I let go of all my memories...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and\u00a0awoke to find myself on a dark train...&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972940/extras/ccebdf1b68f19f19c6f364d634447bae.webp?t=1752827754\" width=616 height=23 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972940/extras/facdfc9c6a93e868f9eb6ad417fa7907.avif?t=1752827754\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2176, Neo Japan</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As social problems grow worse, a terror group wants to create their own nation in cyberspace. They threaten to launch bio-terror attacks across Neo Japan to force the government's hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After checking every lead, the government discovers that the key to stopping the attack lies in an unexpected place\u2014inside the frozen brain of someone who died back in the 1970s.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You become an <strong>Agent</strong>, wandering through a maze of memories. Can you find the key to save the future? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972940/extras/ccebdf1b68f19f19c6f364d634447bae.webp?t=1752827754\" width=616 height=23 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972940/extras/00d0b8b5fe7a5c2082ec32047ac44d58.avif?t=1752827754\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972940/extras/5659b0c6f7cdb2e7770a84627f90b503.poster.avif?t=1752827754\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972940/extras/5659b0c6f7cdb2e7770a84627f90b503.webm?t=1752827754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972940/extras/5659b0c6f7cdb2e7770a84627f90b503.mp4?t=1752827754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to &lt;M.E.M.O.&gt; - The Memory of the Dead</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk through beautiful, retro scenes and discover hidden clues. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sharp eyes and careful observation will be the key to solving every mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972940/extras/ccebdf1b68f19f19c6f364d634447bae.webp?t=1752827754\" width=616 height=23 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972940/extras/9feeee610ccb0d144d3f671b3f7db2f2.avif?t=1752827754\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972940/extras/bdcfbcf62c670a7c8706c0f741966445.poster.avif?t=1752827754\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972940/extras/bdcfbcf62c670a7c8706c0f741966445.webm?t=1752827754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972940/extras/bdcfbcf62c670a7c8706c0f741966445.mp4?t=1752827754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Secret World Woven with Codes and Puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use analog thinking and logical reasoning to experience hardcore code-breaking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > With your own hands, uncover all the secrets buried by time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972940/extras/ccebdf1b68f19f19c6f364d634447bae.webp?t=1752827754\" width=616 height=23 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972940/extras/ce47847497a9fd93b66cec43b3ddfcc6.avif?t=1752827754\" width=616 height=64 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972940/extras/e6409aab47a363b41ab30a1e0cb67108.avif?t=1752827754\" data-has-big width=800 height=800 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hound</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main character - a skilled Agent with strong willpower and sharp insight. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He acts like a gentleman most of the time, but when someone crosses the line, he shows fierce anger. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A man with two sides to his personality.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972940/extras/3fdb8ca2ce3a5784ca92f623e7650dbf.avif?t=1752827754\" data-has-big width=800 height=800 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vergilia</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The navigator who supports the main character. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She doesn't care much about other people and rarely shows emotions, good or bad. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a designer baby, she struggles deeply with questions about her purpose and future.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
